  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/curse-of-knowledge/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#SelfCheckQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/curse-of-knowledge/check/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Which terms, acronyms or steps in this message did I learn on the job rather than expect my reader to know?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/curse-of-knowledge/check/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/communication-graph/id/curse-of-knowledge> .
